%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 신청자격 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2학기 이상 등록한 대학원 석ㆍ박사과정 재학생 및 컨설팅대학원 석사과정 재학생</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 제출서류 </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">▶ 면제신청원 1부, 면제관련 증빙서류(사본) 1부 첨부 </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. 외국어시험 면제요건 </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">가. 최근3년이내 및 본교 대학원 해당과정 중에 TOEIC성적 500점</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(TOEFL, TEPS의 점수는 토익 500점에 상응하는 점수)이상을 취득한 자</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ 2010학년도 이후 박사과정 입학생은 TOEIC 성적이 550점</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(TOEFL, TEPS의 점수는 토익 550점에 상응하는 점수)이상을 취득한 자</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">나. 본교 대학원 해당과정 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">재학 중</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 어학교육원에서 시행하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">중급이상의 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">영어강좌를 40시간 이상 이수한 자</span></span></u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(2011학년도 이전 입학생까지만 가능)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 외국어시험 면제신청 접수기간 및 장소</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">가. 접수 기간 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012. 05. 08(화) ~ 05. 11(금)[4일간]</span></u></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">나. 접수 장소 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">각 학과 종합학사행정실</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\